  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.6.2 - No API changes and nothing to migrate; the packaged platforms behave as in 2.6.1. Mac Catalyst and tvOS can now be built from source against the project's MonoGame fork (they aren't in these packages). Also removes unused internal label code.\n2.6.1 - Linux/macOS label fixes: CCLabel now disposes the native Skia canvas and font it creates on each redraw, and its SkiaSharp backend moved off deprecated text APIs (no rendering change). No API changes.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
